7. **Do not send real reminder emails during tests unless explicitly authorized.**
8. **Do not execute the destructive financial reset without an explicit final confirmation.**
9. **Do not delete real financial records or unrelated Firestore data.**
10. **Do not weaken security rules to make tests pass.**
11. **Do not commit, push, merge or deploy to production without explicit authorization.**
12. **Do not leave a known security bypass unresolved and still report the feature as complete.**

The goal is to bring the actual existing platform into alignment with both previous implementation briefs—not to produce a report that merely says the work has been reviewed.

